# The champion carrying the finisher: flame-close + one nuke launcher.
# Built for the failed-close class -- vh-final's 24601 capped out at worth
# 63,600 vs 24,900, a won position out of clock -- where the late game has
# exactly the surplus the Impossible screens proved the launcher needs
# (income gate 50/s, `runs/sweeps/imp-nuke2`, log 2026-08-05). The question
# this arm asks: does a warhead convert dominance the march cannot?

name flame-nuke
goals extractorT1,extractorT1,extractorT1,c_tank,c_tank,c_tank,hoverTank,c_artillery
heavies heavyTank,heavyTank
max_workers 8
mass 25
